  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for Elastic.Clients.Elasticsearch 8+ — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for any Elasticsearch operation, plus a built-in ElasticTransientErrors predicate covering rate limiting (429), service unavailability (503), gateway timeouts (504), and connection failures.",
